rs, and the surf roars softly.*#WHITE#\n\nThis was such a lovely idea!\nI have had a wonderful time with you today.\n\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*She looks longingly into your eyes.*#WHITE#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#LIGHT_GREEN#*你们两个在沙滩上放松了一阵子。\n空气清新，沙滩闪闪发光，\n海浪发出轻柔的涛声。*#WHITE#\n\n来海边真是个好主意！\n今天和你玩得很开心啊。\n\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*她含情脉脉地凝视着你。*#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"738781451083ab5c8722904c68876842bdf54ee36f6211307e0d04e142109dd7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b96f1139f24bec714eaad180d3b40c252b52bf5936e6a29919015ab0931ff819","logical_entry_identity":"03de50f045545abbc4c5fe143f648a3e66d8782644c7aa95079a4934f7600a23","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Boss fight!","source_tag":"_t","target":"Boss战！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d52ef06b6eba3d906e0e1097a5a2497b8fd1ffe3ccba9c69f8d124cc756d93a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b9700b83557f0f612f3c96ae537f92d836e687f3e430413338e56a5974b2e54e","logical_entry_identity":"57386c71a06b68890961de3ec58d99c61551c452479e4f761f00062d15059994","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Meet the guardian!","source_tag":"_t","target":"去见时空守卫！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8470268b83f5d308cfad77d23027fc249af0412f0c8c3a0aa7c5f55d8a3c4d29","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b975d69d938c5328b5e34f91d1874a499654e135bd5414a4f901a99e85e4a52b","logical_entry_identity":"bfd1ec839832c1d31a851f1305c9e8b21cdd01162e7a5a336ed4412cc49459fa","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"glyph of explosion","source_tag":"_t","target":"爆炸圣印"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"920a1f955b2ae70aa8b9fd01a0f90eb8d87aba161dfe89aa8625c701ce25d5be","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b97695a3afdaf1664b1f52bd7e754d473d3b87ec7ad0b3022a6c564c50615678","logical_entry_identity":"fd705f78da7c79304f483e611d03b87ae4bf26c15e57ec1105a87fd93bc3d784","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have gained the full power of the various drakes throughout the world, and have become both resistant and attuned to physical, fire, cold, lightning, acid, nature, blight, and darkness damage.\n\t\tYour resistance to these elements is increased by %0.1f%% and all damage you deal with them is increased by %0.1f%% with %0.1f%% resistance penetration.\n\n\t\tLearning this talent will add a Willpower bonus to your breath talent damage with the same scaling as Strength, effectively doubling it when the stats are equal.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你获得了世界中数不清的龙的力量传承，你对物理、火焰、寒冷、闪电、酸性、自然、枯萎和暗影属性伤害的抵抗力和适应力增强了。\n\t\t你对这些属性的抗性提升 %0.1f%%，使用这些属性的时候伤害提升 %0.1f%%，获得 %0.1f%% 伤害穿透。\n\n\t\t学习此技能后，你的龙息技能伤害将在原来受力量属性加成的基础上，额外受到意志属性加成，加成比例相等。举例而言，如果你的意志值和力量值相等，你的龙息技能伤害，将达到学习此技能前的两倍。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"134e021f53e387798d3ef08a8c7c43de9a7e881d04f6adef87a9ff384f3a9805","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b97a5c8a1a62553fb2458eedf161eda025f9bf91bd5f94ebbbb77ec71ea68be5","logical_entry_identity":"f9b7336615cc701d0c9cfe2046ca4bb2c022b2a749f3794ae24bf78f5634adff","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Through ignorance, greed or folly the Cursed served some dark design and are now doomed to pay for their sins.","source_tag":"_t","target":"被诅咒者曾经因为无知、贪婪或者愚昧，服从于黑暗的指示。现在，他们因罪恶而身受灾难折磨。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4fe00fcfac340c89a857885e8797b7c3937d22075da1301f607d04a7b9ed0e14","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b980d12aa659ccb787c3fd5fd6fcb164c4ac6bc018b3f684413ceb880da5e4d3","logical_entry_identity":"4efd827be37adcac2f623a92cac34559ad02eac6870115867daaeb17a671af0b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Sandworm Queen","source_tag":"entity name","target":"沙虫女皇"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"eb68ea9d5dbff71083ce970db0fcd326aa53757ad58f4c0fd7cc1eb9a18ae6f2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b981ba85894e0d85b65224ec340d990675e3fe2ef4ce4b7589b7bfee32bc017d","logical_entry_identity":"d2b33251f6bf90c9d9bbfd9e488dc7e21ea7f54494c7096e2f7b84eb5cee8139","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Well, actually...","source_tag":"_t",