 dark shifting shape stalks through the shadows, blending in seamlessly.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个暗色变换的身影在阴影中潜行，完美地融入其中。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"63a2b8d76a6a301b5572897c4d93c28f6fa4c4bdd97e9cebbdac125ac3412561","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b9b109bae82324a806d3e2977ffbd1144054bcb4bc2800715211b97a28fa13dd","logical_entry_identity":"e8103753e29a39cee89c0056bae934ea0b2fa05443754fb918f3c22ecbb6ea82","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Brawlers are trained in the use of their fists and mastery of their bodies. They can be as dangerous in combat as any swordsman.","source_tag":"init.lua load_tips","target":"格斗家通过学习对自身力量的掌握，并将其发挥至极限，他们的拳头是他们唯一的武器，但其杀伤力不亚于任何一个持剑的战士。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"302e4be12f53a5770bf2052e961d67c77d65f2e365e69be243bbecf71cb9f1aa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b9b81907ae95a7050b561d83c462288bf61166fa956420a5e94731ba102d8155","logical_entry_identity":"0401de16b582c909b1846ed806ea1f5f5c30d06b281e945aa51d7913aa42aaba","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"As your mind-mouse enters the dream portal you suddenly wake up.\nYou feel good!","source_tag":"_t","target":"当梦中的老鼠进入了梦境传送门之时，你突然醒来。\n你感觉神清气爽！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d5ac2fae9ebef98c2438370273818f2bcff2b366d159e3cd1d9cb8f71e80acfa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b9c02e81812ca47757f0330b4f5c87557630e3d69feb61fffb5525640619d5f2","logical_entry_identity":"a3eb4bbf8815189d077b3d9178dec3bb0594660ccf34a9100ee5860d68826f95","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"light amulet","source_tag":"_t","target":"很轻的项链"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4ec7696e8ce2d312cfe212f2cffec057007fd50a4c29763c934fb4a3bd661b2f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b9c081a4edf90d246967f9b3efba27aeb0c1f6e347304151467b1ea7653f9bb9","logical_entry_identity":"911b131d5c070c6ba308e23ab65905cc9486df2040a99fa970d556783dd3c7c6","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You channel acid through your psiblades.","source